{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can't get enough of Necesse and feel like the devs at Fair Games deserves a cake at the office every now and then. Then this Supporter Pack is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In return you will receive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An awesome looking cosmetic armor set to show off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shiny dust particles spraying off you when you walk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up in the dark so your friends always can see how cool you look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional set pieces can be bought from The Elder.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947840/extras/4927236c8b701ea72f21c15366886662.avif?t=1760633885\" alt=\"A display of the supporter armor set showing it from all four possible angles on a player model.\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope the Elder treats you well, that cavelings run your way and that bushes won't stab or bash you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for playing our game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The Fair Games Team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Important:</u></strong> This DLC is a way to support the team behind Necesse. It does not add new content to the game that gives you an advantage, but your purchase supports development on Necesse and future titles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947840?t=1760633885","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947840/e0872efdd25ddec62cae6b2a682c500199119f1c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760633885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947840/8a9